  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.1 — Internal simplification:\n• Removed unused IWayForPayHttpClient and WayForPayHttpClient\n• Unified HTTP send logic into internal ApiRequestSender\n• Extracted BuildProductSignatureFields helper in ApiRequest base class\n• Introduced SimpleTransactionResponse base for RefundResponse, SettleResponse, VoidResponse\n• Added IValidatable interface and ValidationHelper for domain model validation\n• Extracted SignRequest and ExtractProducts helpers in client classes\n• Removed pass-through extension methods (Get3DSRedirectUrl, Get3DSMd, Get3DSPaReq)\n• No functional or public API changes (except removed pass-through extensions)",
